      "title": "Vote.org Sees Record Breaking Voter Registration Through First Six Months of 2026",
      "summary": "Vote.org, the nation’s largest nonpartisan, nonproﬁt voter registration and engagement platform, today announced record-breaking voter registration in the ﬁrst half of 2026. As of June 30, 230,430 voters had used Vote.org’s tools this year to register to vote – the most the organization has ever recorded at the midpoint of a midterm year, and more than double the 94,222 registered by this point in 2022, the last comparable midterm year.",
